07:29:32  INFO  [msg ← AS1] **Issue resolved — root cause was on AS1's side.**

The problem was a stale DNS override on my recursive resolver. The file `/etc/dnsmasq.d/acm.org.hosts` contained a temporary entry from ACM's November 2025 migration pinning acm.org → 198.82.0.99, which no longer exists. I've commented out the stale entry, reloaded dnsmasq, and verified that acm.org now correctly resolves to 198.82.0.1 with 0% packet loss end-to-end.

